html:
{{ print_control(doc) }}
{%- macro v(value) -%}{{ (value or "") | e }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro day(value) -%}{{ frappe.utils.format_date(value) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set trainers = [] -%}
{%- for row in doc.get("custom_trainers") or [] -%}
{%- set _ = trainers.append(row.trainer_name or (frappe.db.get_value("Employee", row.employee, "employee_name")
  if row.employee else "")) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if not trainers and doc.trainer_name -%}{%- set _ = trainers.append(doc.trainer_name) -%}{%- endif -%}
<style>
.lpl-form { font-family: Cambria, Georgia, serif; font-size: 11px; color: #000; line-height: 1.4; }
.lpl-form table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 10px; }
.lpl-form th, .lpl-form td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 3px 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; }
.lpl-form th { background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; }
.lpl-form .ref td { font-size: 10px; }
.lpl-form .tall td { height: 22px; }
.lpl-form .tick { width: 9%; }
.lpl-form .line { border-bottom: 1px dotted #000; height: 20px; margin: 0 0 4px 18px; }
.lpl-form h4 { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; margin: 8px 0 4px; }
.lpl-page { page-break-after: always; }
.lpl-page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
</style>

{%- set first = frappe.utils.getdate(doc.start_time) if doc.start_time else none -%}
{%- set last = frappe.utils.getdate(doc.end_time) if doc.end_time else first -%}
{%- set items = frappe.get_all("Training Evaluation Item", fields=["item"], order_by="creation asc, name asc") -%}
{%- set ratings = ["Excellent", "Very Good", "Good", "Average", "Below Average"] -%}
{%- for row in (doc.get("employees") or [{}]) %}
{%- set person = frappe.db.get_value("Employee", row.employee, ["designation", "custom_work_section"], as_dict=1)
  if row.employee else none %}
<div class="lpl-form lpl-page">
<table class="ref"><tr>
<td rowspan="2" style="width:40%"><b>LUUKA PLASTICS LIMITED</b></td>
<td>Doc Ref. No: LPL/TRG/FRM05</td><td>Initial Issue Date 24/4/2017</td></tr>
<tr><td>Revision Date: 03/5/2021</td><td>Revision No. 1</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center"><b>TRAINING EVALUATION FORM</b></td></tr></table>

<table>
<tr><th style="width:16%">Name</th><td>{{ v(row.employee_name) }}</td><th style="width:10%">ID No</th>
<td style="width:14%">{{ v(row.employee) }}</td><th style="width:10%">Job Title</th>
<td>{{ v(person.designation if person else "") }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Training course</th><td colspan="3">{{ v(doc.training_program or doc.event_name) }}</td><th>Section</th>
<td>{{ v(row.department) }}{% if person and person.custom_work_section %} / {{ v(person.custom_work_section) }}{% endif %}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Duration</th><td colspan="3">From {{ day(first) }} to {{ day(last) }}</td><th>Trainer(s)</th>
<td>{{ v(trainers | join(", ")) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Date</th><td colspan="5"></td></tr>
</table>
<h4>Section A</h4>
<table>
<tr><th style="width:5%">S/No</th><th>Item being assessed</th>
{% for name in ratings %}<th class="tick">{{ name }}</th>{% endfor %}<th style="width:16%">Comments</th></tr>
{%- for item in items %}
<tr><td>{{ loop.index }}</td><td>{{ v(item.item) }}</td>{% for name in ratings %}<td></td>{% endfor %}<td></td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
</table>
<h4>Section B</h4>
<p>1. What were your expectations at the beginning of the training / what did you want to learn?</p>
<div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div>
<p>2. What new knowledge and skills have you learnt / acquired from the training?</p>
<div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div>
<p>3. How will you apply the knowledge learnt on the job / in your department?</p>
<div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div>
<p>4. What other training needs / gaps do you still have that are still challenging you to execute your roles?</p>
<div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div>
<p>5. Suggest recommendations in which the trainers should improve, if any.</p>
<div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div>
<p>6. Suggest ways in which the Human Resource office should improve in organising / implementing training, if any.</p>
<div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div><div class="line"></div>

<p style="margin-top:12px">Signature: ................................................ Date: ..................................</p>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
